{
  "found": true,
  "answer": "You can see wolves in Lamar Valley, which is one of the best places in the world to see wild wolves. Winter is the best season to watch wolves as they are prominent against the snow, especially in January, February, March, and December. You can drive yourself along the road from the North Entrance to the Northeast Entrance, which is open year-round, or join a guided wolf-watching tour from Gardiner. Early morning and dusk are the best times when animals are most active.",
  "sources": [1, 2, 3]
}

